# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules for https://weblyft-design.pages.dev
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Why these exist: Pages serves every page at two URLs - /services.html and
# /services - and returns 200 for both. Every canonical, Open Graph URL,
# internal link and sitemap entry on the site uses the .html form, so the
# extensionless form is the duplicate and gets 301'd to it. That concentrates
# crawl budget and link signals on one URL per page instead of two.
#
# If you would rather use the clean form (/services), that is the better long-term
# choice, but it is not a redirect change: swap the direction of every rule below
# and rewrite the canonical, og:url and sitemap entries on all 22 pages in the
# same pass, so the redirect and the canonical agree.
#
# Rules are first-match-wins, so keep the specific paths above any wildcard you
# add later. A path that matches nothing here falls through to the static asset.

# Home: the canonical is "/", not "/index.html"
/index.html / 301

# Top-level pages
/services /services.html 301
/websites /websites.html 301
/chatbots /chatbots.html 301
/aeo-geo /aeo-geo.html 301
/gallery /gallery.html 301
/about /about.html 301
/contact /contact.html 301
/privacy /privacy.html 301
/terms /terms.html 301
/blog /blog.html 301

# Guides. Listed individually rather than with a /blog/:slug splat, because a
# splat would also match the already-.html URLs and redirect
# /blog/mobile-first-design.html to /blog/mobile-first-design.html.html.
/blog/color-psychology-in-web-design /blog/color-psychology-in-web-design.html 301
/blog/how-to-choose-the-right-website-platform /blog/how-to-choose-the-right-website-platform.html 301
/blog/how-to-write-website-copy-that-converts /blog/how-to-write-website-copy-that-converts.html 301
/blog/mobile-first-design /blog/mobile-first-design.html 301
/blog/seo-basics-get-found-on-google /blog/seo-basics-get-found-on-google.html 301
/blog/ultimate-guide-to-building-a-business-website /blog/ultimate-guide-to-building-a-business-website.html 301
/blog/web-design-trends /blog/web-design-trends.html 301
/blog/website-hosting-explained /blog/website-hosting-explained.html 301
/blog/website-optimization-speed-tips /blog/website-optimization-speed-tips.html 301
/blog/what-is-aeo-and-geo /blog/what-is-aeo-and-geo.html 301

# Trailing-slash variants, in case a link somewhere carries one
/services/ /services.html 301
/websites/ /websites.html 301
/chatbots/ /chatbots.html 301
/aeo-geo/ /aeo-geo.html 301
